<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg 98-day muni yields 18.82 pct.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg 98-day muni yields 18.82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised average yield on an additional 98-day tranche of GGKO municipal bonds was 18.82 percent at an auction on Wednesday, general agent AVK said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Series number			   SU32019GSPMO</p>
<p>    Volume				    70 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			   100,000 rbls</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			  148.31 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Sold					 68.70 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Proceeds				   65.39 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Average price			    95.19 pct</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted price		  95.19 pct</p>
<p>    Average yield			    18.82 pct</p>
<p>    Highest accepted yield		 18.82 pct</p>
<p>    Tenor					98 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			    September 17, 1997</p>
<p>--St Petersburg Newsroom, +7812 219 92 09</p>
